<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1554_5615.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> willig dienst und
<lb n="2"/>gruoß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">edler</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vester</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erenvesten</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/>fürsichtigen, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wisen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear> lieben
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heren</unclear>, guoten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>, und nachbaren.
<lb n="5"/>Nach dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zits</unclear> her ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">große</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">merckliche</unclear> anzal <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mäncher</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nuwer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">behempsch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">drükrützer</unclear>, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glichwol</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>an silber halt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnuog</unclear>, an der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uf</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zal</unclear> aber gar ring und schlecht sind,
<lb n="10"/>in unser aller <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heren</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obern</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>jurisdictionen mit so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">großem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hauffen</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ingerissen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">usserhalb</unclear> derselben
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schier</unclear> kein ander <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müntzsorten</unclear>, insonder-
<lb n="14"/>heit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">die</unclear> groben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müntzen</unclear> nit mehr
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesehen</unclear> werden. Daher der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gmein</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>man <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">siten</unclear> höchlich beschwert,
<lb n="17"/>habend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßwegen</unclear> unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allersit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heren</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obern</unclear> unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anbefolhen</unclear>, unß
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">miteinandern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zebehrahtschlagen</unclear>,
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welchermaßen</unclear> doch hierinnen ein mode-
<lb n="21"/>ration getroffen, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anleitung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesuocht</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>werden möchte, damit der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">überschwall</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>solcher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">behempfen</unclear> verhuetet, und dargegen
<lb n="24"/>die guoten groben gold- und silber-
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müntzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlichermaßen</unclear> wider <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">in</unclear>-
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefuert</unclear> wurden. Und
<lb n="27"/>nach dem wir unß deßhalb lang
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">miteinandern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">behrahtschlaget</unclear>, so
<lb n="29"/>haben wir geachtet, hierzuo ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitel</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solte</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wan</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ungrische</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>ducaten und andre goldsorten, wie
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1554_5616.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/>auch die groben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">silbermüntzen</unclear>, in
<lb n="33"/>ein hoehern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werd</unclear> gesetzt, und umb
<lb n="34"/>etwas <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesteigert</unclear> werden. Die=
<lb n="35"/>wil aber wir geachtet es moechte
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vileicht</unclear> in der umbligenden nachbar=
<lb n="37"/>schafft (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> mit denen wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>taeglichen handel und wandel haben
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mueßend</unclear>.) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> ungleichheit
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geberen</unclear>. So habend wir nit
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear> ermanglen E. W. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fl</unclear>.
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. W. wie auch den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ubrigen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-157" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Bodensee</placeName> umbligenden
<lb n="44"/>stetten, ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt=</unclear>
<lb n="45"/>lich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> communicieren, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darneben</unclear>
<lb n="46"/>darüber iren bericht und meinung,
<lb n="47"/>ob sy ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölches</unclear> für <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhatsam</unclear> halten
<lb n="48"/>oder wie man denen sachen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sunsten</unclear>
<lb n="49"/>am fueglichsten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">köndte</unclear>, nach=
<lb n="50"/>barlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzuohören</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Biten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daruff</unclear>
<lb n="51"/>E. W. und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fl</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. W. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündt=</unclear>
<lb n="52"/>nachbarlich, die wellen ir
<lb n="53"/>meinung, einem erb. rhat der
<lb n="54"/>statt Sant Gallen, hierüber mit
<lb n="55"/>erstem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuowüßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear>. Und
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seyen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sunsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsre</unclear> herren und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obern</unclear>,
<lb n="57"/>wie auch wir für <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsre</unclear> personen,
<lb n="58"/>zuo guter nachbarschafft, und allen
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angenemen</unclear> diensten, jederzeit
<lb n="60"/>wol gewogen. Datum, und in
<lb n="61"/>unser aller namen, mit der statt
<lb n="62"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sant Gallen</placeName> secret <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insigel</unclear> ver=
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1554_5617.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ment</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auf</unclear> den .<origDate when="1607-06-12" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">17</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">12</unclear>. Junii
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Anno</unclear> 1607</origDate>.
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Der</unclear> vier oberkeiten, namlich
<lb n="66"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inneren</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">usseren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">roden</unclear>
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> landts <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-8" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Abbenzell</unclear></placeName>, wie
<lb n="68"/>auch herrn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abbts</unclear> und der
<lb n="69"/>statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St. Gallen</placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verordnete</unclear>
<lb n="70"/>rhatsbotten, der zeit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> be=
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">velch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> aller <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heren</unclear>, in
<lb n="72"/>der statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St. Gallen</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bijein=</unclear>
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versambt</unclear>.
<lb n="74"/>Den edlen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vesten</unclear> etc.
<lb n="75"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verwaltern</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hauptmanschafft</unclear>,
<lb n="76"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-56" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgermeister</unclear> und rhat <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> statt Costantz</orgName>
<lb n="77"/>etc.
<lb n="78"/>mutatis mutandis.
<lb n="79"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gen</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-24" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lindaw</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="80"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-4" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Vberlingen</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="81"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ratolffzell</unclear></placeName>.
